        "original_id": "f5d08b60-3fc0-5e67-a172-208c8f7cad76",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lee Jong-suk, Han Hyo-joo, Yoo Jun-sang, Kim Eui-sung\n- Works: School 2013, I Can Hear Your Voice, Doctor Stranger, Pinocchio, W\n- Events: 2012 KBS Drama Awards\n- Roles: actor, model, host\n\nFacts:\n- Lee Jong-suk was born on 14 September 1989 and is a South Korean actor and model.\n- Lee Jong-suk's breakout role was in the 2012 work \"School 2013.\"\n- The 2012 KBS Drama Awards was held on December 31, 2012 and was hosted by Yoo Jun-sang and Lee Jong-suk.\n- Lee Jong-suk is also known for his role in the 2013 work \"I Can Hear Your Voice.\"\n- Lee Jong-suk is also known for roles in the 2014 works \"Doctor Stranger\" and \"Pinocchio.\"\n- \"W\" is a 2016 South Korean television series starring Lee Jong-suk and Han Hyo-joo.\n- Kim Eui-sung appears in the 2016 TV series \"W.\"",
